    {
      "title": "v1.0.5\u306e\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30c7\u30fc\u30c8\u5185\u5bb9",
      "date": "2025-06-01 05:32:55",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1800991756403348",
      "content": "[b]Implementation[/b]\n[list]\n[*] Save and load functionality to Steam Cloud Save has been implemented. *In order to sync data, you need to save the slot you want to save once after this version.\n[/list]\n\n[b]Adjustment[/b]\n[list]\n[*] The MP consumption of Lara's skill \u201c\u6d88\u5931\u30de\u30b8\u30c3\u30af\u201d has been reduced.\n[*] Milne's passive \u201c\u6d44\u5316\u201d effect is now only applied to attack skills.\n[*] The effects of Lux's passives \u201c\u8edf\u5316\u306e\u6c34\u201d and \u201c\u61a4\u6012\u306e\u708e\u201d are now only applied to weather attack skills.\n[/list]\n\n[b]Bug Fixes[/b]\n[list]\n[*] Fixed a bug where the count would advance faster if the play time exceeded a certain amount of time, and then stop counting after another certain amount of time.\n[*] Fixed a bug that caused a freeze when opening the menu when there was only one character in the party and that character exited.\n[*] Fixed a bug that caused the passive of speed change systems to be calculated to be larger than before.\n[*] Fixed a bug in which when multiple passives with the same effect and different category targets were learned, the effect was not activated for one category and the corresponding effect was applied to the other. (Example: \u201c\u30a2\u30cb\u30de\u30de\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc II\u201d and \"\u8449\u679d\u30de\u30b9\u30bf\u30fcII. The CT reduction in \u201c\u8449\u679d\u30de\u30b9\u30bf\u30fcII\u201d was not applied to the \u201c\u8449\u679d\u201d skill, but to the \u201c\u30a2\u30cb\u30de\u201d skill).\n[*] Fixed a bug where the listed MP was not consumed when using Lara's skill \u201c\u6d88\u5931\u30de\u30b8\u30c3\u30af\u201d.\n[*] The image of Lara's skill \u201c\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30c1\u30e5\u30f3\u30eb\u30fc\u30ec\u30c3\u30c8\u201d has been corrected.\n[*] Fixed a bug in which the MP consumption of the escape penalty was not eliminated when using Lara's \"\u6d88\u5931\u30de\u30b8\u30c3\u30af\u201d while Lim's passive \u201c\u7bc0\u7d04\u9003\u8d70\u201d was being learned.\n[*] \u7279\u5b9a\u306e\u624b\u9806\u3092\u8e0f\u3080\u3068\u3001\u8607\u751f\u3057\u305f\u6575\u304b\u3089\u30c9\u30ed\u30c3\u30d7\u3057\u305f\u30a2\u30a4\u30c6\u30e0\u304c\u5165\u624b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u306a\u3044\u6271\u3044\u306b\u306a\u308b\u30d0\u30b0\u3092\u4fee\u6b63\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30d0\u30b0\u3067\u5165\u624b\u3067\u304d\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u306b\u5bfe\u3057\u300c\u751f\u6bba\u3057\u306e\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u300d\u306e\u4ed8\u4e0e\u51e6\u7406\u3092\u5b9f\u88c5\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\n[*] Fixed a bug that caused items dropped from revived enemies to be treated as not obtained when certain steps were taken. The granting process of \u201c\u751f\u6bba\u3057\u306e\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u201d has been implemented for data that could not be obtained due to this bug.\n[*] A bug that prevented the effect of Lux's passive \u201c\u5929\u5019\u30de\u30b9\u30bf\u30fcI Lv.9\u201d from being activated has been fixed.\n[*] Fixed a blackjack card image that was displayed incorrectly.\n[*] Fixed a case where certain associates would speak before becoming associates.\n[*] Corrections were made to the hit points on the map.\n[*] Corrected typographical errors.\n[/list]\n",
